  "facts": [
    "The Crafting Station is a defensive building unlocked at the highest Town Hall level (currently level 18), which can be toggled between three different modes, each with their advantages and disadvantages. It is free and covers a 3x3 area of the base.",
    "Modules are improvements of defenses that can be upgraded, up to level 10 each. Each module controls a certain aspect of the defense, such as hitpoints, damage, attack frequency or unique effects.",
    "Crafted Defenses will always defend the village, even while upgrading. They will also start at level 3 (level 1 for each of the three modules), and can be upgraded up to level 30 (with all modules at level 10).",
    "Leveling one Crafted Defense to the maximum gives a total of 216 .",
    "Leveling all current available three Crafted Defenses to the maximum gives a total of 648 ."
  ],
